.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-step-graph-run 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-step\-graph\-run \- Run a group\*(Aqs rows, dependencies first and at most \-\-jobs at once, and exit with the worst row\*(Aqs code
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten step graph run\fR [\fB\-\-jobs\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIgroup\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run a group\*(Aqs rows, dependencies first and at most \-\-jobs at once, and exit with the worst row\*(Aqs code
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-jobs\fR \fI<jobs>\fR
Run at most this many of the group\*(Aqs rows at once (a positive integer; default: no bound)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIgroup\fR>
The graph to run, as the step table\*(Aqs `group` field names it
